7, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.466748058795928955", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199150821", "author": {"steamid": "76561197964000775", "personaname": "Spiro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197964000775/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 617, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 611, "last_played": 1751983102, "avatar": "704a0d492775c64d1b4bd593c0bc3aadfdcc59ae"}, "language": "english", "review": "Me like!", "timestamp_created": 1751839942, "timestamp_updated": 1751839942, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199146723", "author": {"steamid": "76561198115166747", "personaname": "Mallasorte", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198115166747/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1610, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 286, "last_played": 1786793450, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "super", "timestamp_created": 1751836375, "timestamp_updated": 1751836375, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199145416", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971052470", "personaname": "Basch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197971052470/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 476, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 476, "last_played": 1751834883, "avatar": "5481116a6dab705551c96ea947734face710d4fb"}, "language": "english", "review": "No, I can't recommend this game. It's simply far too short to justify its status as a standalone title. The levels feel cramped and uninspired, more like bite-sized missions than full-fledged battlegrounds. Honestly, this should have been released as a DLC expansion for Sniper Elite 5, not marketed as a separate game.\n\nDon’t get me wrong — it’s not a bad game. The mechanics are solid, and the signature Sniper Elite feel is there. But everything about it feels scaled down, simplified, as if it’s merely a shadow of what it could have been. It lacks the depth and scope one expects from a full release.\n\nThat said, if you can pick it up during a sale for around ten bucks, it’s a decent little distraction — just don’t expect a full-blown experience.", "timestamp_created": 1751835321, "timestamp_updated": 1751835321, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 33, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.756336033344268799", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199145373", "author": {"steamid": "76561198035885862", "personaname": "Bartjoh", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Dutchnonsense/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 609, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 609, "last_played": 1751835051, "avatar": "a47988d904318161ca371464c41fa7ef23bd954e"}, "language": "english", "review": "For a game at this price point, the campaign felt disappointingly short.\n\nWhile we genuinely enjoyed our time playing through it, we were honestly taken aback at how quickly it was over. \nIt left us with a sense of unfinished business as if the experience was cut short just when it was getting good.\n\nWhat’s more frustrating is the feeling that this was done deliberately, with additional content carved out to be sold later as DLC. This kind of money-grabbing approach, where players are expected to pay extra for what should have been part of the base game, leaves a sour taste. It’s a disappointing trend in modern game publishing, and one that undermines the value of an otherwise enjoyable title.", "timestamp_created": 1751835282, "timestamp_updated": 1751835282, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.547325074672698975", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32706", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-9900K CPU @ 3.60GHz", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 Ti", "vram_size": 12086}, "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "199136825", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127226553", "personaname": "IAS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198127226553/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 2277, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1292, "last_played": 1753327112, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Having 100 enemies that can see and shoot through 10m thick concrete walls is not called difficulty but stupidity. Fire whoever wrote this part of code.\nMain quests require satchel charges, and guess what, they aren't available. They force you to walk around the map for 2 hours every single mission just to find the satchel charges. No other explosives work.", "timestamp_created": 1751828615, "timestamp_updated": 1751844890, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "199120709", "author": {"steamid": "76561199039028660", "personaname": "books8900", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/091401/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 99, "playtime_forever": 1327, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 794, "last_played": 1759024464, "avatar": "54be38c13d0e7792de2af9a76c4e376766cf697a"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is an amazing game. It is unfortunate so many fans think it is a shameless reskin of the other games.", "timestamp_created": 1751816784, "timestamp_updated": 1751816784, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}